.\"
.Dd $Mdocdate: October 22 2026 $
.Dt SL.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sl.conf
.Nd Starlink dish monitor configuration
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the configuration file for
.Xr sld 8
and
.Xr slctl 8 .
The installed path is
.Pa /etc/sl.conf .
Lines are
.Li key = value .
Blank lines and lines whose first non-whitespace character is
.Ql #
are ignored.
Unknown keys are rejected.
.Pp
.Xr sld 8
reads the file as user
.Sy _sl .
The file mode is 0640, owner
.Sy root:_sl ,
so a password stored in
.Va pg_password
is not world-readable.
.Dv SIGHUP
and
.Ic rcctl reload sld
read the file again.
See
.Xr sld 8
for which keys apply immediately.
.Pp
Keys and their defaults:
.Bl -tag -width "minutely_retention_days"
.It Va db
.Li sqlite
or
.Li pg .
.It Va db_path
.Pa /var/sl/sl.db .
The SQLite file.
Ignored when
.Va db
is
.Li pg .
.Fl d
overrides it for one process.
.It Va listen
.Li 127.0.0.1:8080 .
Must be
.Li host:port .
One line.
The port is 0 or at least 1024.
.It Va dish_host
.Li 192.168.100.1 .
A suffix
.Li :port
replaces the default port 9200.
.It Va dish_interval_s
.Li 30 .
Minimum 2.
.It Va dish_client
.Li perl
or
.Li xs .
.Li perl
is the built-in client and the default.
.Li xs
uses
.Li Dish.so ,
which the default build does not produce.
Build it with
.Li WITH_DISH_XS=yes .
.Nm sld
restarts the dish process when this value changes.
.It Va log_level
.Li info
or
.Li debug .
.Li debug
records rollup bucket counts and which table a chart read.
The session secret, the password, and
.Va pg_password
are not logged.
.It Va raw_retention_days
.Li 90 .
.It Va hourly_rollup_days
.Li 365 .
.It Va minutely_retention_days
.Li 730 .
.It Va rollup_interval_s
.Li 60 .
Minimum 1.
.It Va ping_targets
.Li 1.1.1.1,8.8.8.8 .
Comma-separated hosts.
.It Va ping_interval_s
.Li 10 .
.It Va disconnect_failures
.Li 3 .
.It Va spike_ms
.Li 200 .
.It Va spike_min_s
.Li 30 .
.It Va latitude , Va longitude
Decimal degrees.
Set both or neither.
Setting both starts the weather process.
.It Va pg_host , Va pg_port , Va pg_db , Va pg_user , Va pg_password
PostgreSQL connection.
.Va pg_host
is the directory of the local socket when it begins with a slash.
.Va db No = Li pg
requires
.Va pg_db .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/sl.conf
The file
.Xr sld 8
is started with.
.It Pa /usr/local/share/examples/slmon/sl.conf
Sample installed with the package.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr slctl 8 ,
.Xr sld 8
